{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "⚠️ **表头圆点的 y 锚在标题实测框上,不许写常量**(2026-08-31 全仓收口,canonical=gen_asc.py):\n`y=\"{<标题id>.y}+({<标题id>.h}-<直径>pt)/2\"` —— 标题保持 `h:\"-1\"`,引擎按**真实字体度量**\n量出标题框高、再把圆点摆到正中,换字号/字体/端都自动跟上。\n原先是人肉试出来的常量 y(等于拿肉眼猜行高):2026-08-27 那轮「逐卡调 y 收敛到 <0.9pt」\n治的是症状,同一批卡 08-31 又被用户报出来。\n· 备选写法 `h:\"20pt\" + alignmentV:\"1\"`(定高带内居中)也有效,不用它是因为要凭空定一个带高。\n⚠️ 布局字段里的纯锚点算术是规范允许的(`+ - * / %` 与括号);那条「坐标不支持减法」\n说的是 `${数据变量}pt-24pt`,与纯锚点算术不是一回事。\n2026-09-25 体检:卡名 y 11 / 锚 y 14 与本包其它组件同;行 y 38 起、条中线对齐文字墨迹中线(原条比字低 4.4pt);空轨改本包暖色轨道;删掉空态压在轨道上的居中说明。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "模型分布",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "basis": "按累计输出 token 计 · 共 ",
        "basisT": ""
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "By model",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "basis": "Share of all-time output tokens · ",
        "basisT": " total"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-140pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-124pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "110pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "_note": "时效锚 y = 卡名 y + 3:txt 盒顶 = 墨迹顶,同盒顶时 9pt 锚的基线比 13pt 卡名高 4.5pt(cell_align 实测),+3 后差 ≤ 1pt(卡片设计系统 §3「与组件名同基线」)"
      },
      {
        "_note": "固定槽 ×4：**不在 forEach 里**，所以无数据时这四条骨架照画 —— 这才是 G9「空态不空白」的落法。填充条由 forEach 盖在其上。",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "80pt",
        "y": "37.7pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-134pt",
        "h": "8pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "4pt",
          "leftB": "4pt",
          "rightT": "4pt",
          "rightB": "4pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "80pt",
        "y": "60.7pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-134pt",
        "h": "8pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "4pt",
          "leftB": "4pt",
          "rightT": "4pt",
          "rightB": "4pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "80pt",
        "y": "83.7pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-134pt",
        "h": "8pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "4pt",
          "leftB": "4pt",
          "rightT": "4pt",
          "rightB": "4pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "80pt",
        "y": "106.7pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-134pt",
        "h": "8pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "4pt",
          "leftB": "4pt",
          "rightT": "4pt",
          "rightB": "4pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "_note": "四行条形。⚠️ 条底板画在 op:if 之外，有没有数据都留住版式(memory grid-heatmap-rcn-pattern)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${models}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "if",
            "props": {
              "val": "$[lt::(${_i},4)]"
            },
            "react": [
              {
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "14pt",
                "y": "38pt+${_i}*23pt",
                "w": "62pt",
                "h": "-1",
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${_it.label},--)]",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
                "maxLines": "1"
              },
              {
                "_note": "⚠️ 宽度是**布局表达式**，不是方法计算：`{parent.w}` 是布局锚点，塞进 `$[calc::()]` 里两类语法就混了(CLAUDE.md「三类严格区分」) —— 表现是槽渲得出、填充条一根都不画，且零报错。forEach 里 pct 由服务端保证恒有值，故不需要 findNotEmpty 兜底。\n颜色跟模型走(2026-09-25):服务端给每行的 c(「浅|深」串),与首页、每日费用、详情页同一套钉槽,Opus 5 恒蓝,不随排名变。老服务端没有 c → 退回原来的按排名橙色深浅。",
                "type": "layer",
                "x": "80pt",
                "y": "37.7pt+${_i}*23pt",
                "w": "({parent.w}-134pt)*${_it.pct}/100",
                "h": "8pt",
                "cornerRadius": {
                  "leftT": "4pt",
                  "leftB": "4pt",
                  "rightT": "4pt",
                  "rightB": "4pt"
                },
                "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.c},),if::(eq::(${_i},0),#EA580C|#E8916B,if::(eq::(${_i},1),#E8916B|#C15F3C,if::(eq::(${_i},2),#FDBA74|#9A3412,#FED7AA|#7C2D12))),${_it.c})]"
              },
              {
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "{parent.w}-50pt",
                "y": "38pt+${_i}*23pt",
                "w": "36pt",
                "h": "-1",
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${_it.pct},--)]%",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "alignmentH": "2",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
                "maxLines": "1"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "口径行(2026-10-08):百分比按**累计输出 token** 算(resp.merged.models 是全部历史),与页面「模型」按费用排的占比不是同一个数,必须写明。合计复用 summary.df 的 outNum/outUnit,零新增请求;空态照画「--」。",
        "id": "basis",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "134pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.basis}$[findNotEmpty::(${outNum},--)]${outUnit}${@i18n.basisT}",
        "fontSize": "9.5pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      }
    ],
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "basisT"
    ]
  }
}
